1
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:10,750
Your power… it's monstrous.

2
00:00:10,875 --> 00:00:13,083
You actually survived one hit.

3
00:00:13,666 --> 00:00:14,708
Good for you.

4
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:15,916
Hah.

5
00:00:15,916 --> 00:00:19,000
How do you think
I conquered half the world?

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,500
Too bad.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,666
You still have to die.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,708
This is not over!

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,291
Dragon Breath of the Abyss!

10
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:58,500
Divine Manifestation. 
Dragon Slayer.

11
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:31,375
You think you
deserve to fight me?

12
00:01:31,375 --> 00:01:33,625
Heh… you think you won?

13
00:01:35,041 --> 00:01:37,041
I have Elowen’s father.

14
00:01:37,583 --> 00:01:41,500
If they don’t hear from
me by nightfall, he dies.

15
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:46,791
My lord, the Black Dragon Covenant has taken my father.

16
00:01:46,791 --> 00:01:48,375
They demand you come.

17
00:01:48,375 --> 00:01:50,083
Tell them I’m coming.

18
00:01:52,416 --> 00:01:54,333
So, my dear Godfather...

19
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,125
you gonna trade the supreme

20
00:01:56,125 --> 00:01:58,750
Morellan family for my life?

21
00:01:58,833 --> 00:02:01,208
No one threatens me.

22
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:03,791
Find the demon who took him.

23
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:05,375
Round up his entire family.

24
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:07,000
What are you doing?

25
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:13,500
None of your concern. Just die.

26
00:02:20,041 --> 00:02:21,625
One more hour.

27
00:02:22,083 --> 00:02:25,583
If your precious Godfather son-in-law 
doesn't show up by then,

28
00:02:25,833 --> 00:02:27,416
your head comes off.

29
00:02:27,416 --> 00:02:30,125
The Godfather doesn’t bow to threats.

30
00:02:30,166 --> 00:02:31,791
Give it up.

31
00:02:33,041 --> 00:02:37,083
They say the Godfather values family above all else.

32
00:02:37,083 --> 00:02:38,958
That makes you his weakness.

33
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,708
Anyone who touches my family dies!
